               <title>WARNING</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">KEEP THIS PRODUCT OUT OF THE REACH OF CHILDREN. IF OVERDOSAGE IS SUSPECTED, SEEK PROFESSIONAL ASSISTANCE OR CONTACT A POISON CONTROL CENTER IMMEDIATELY 1-800-222-1222.</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">SHAKE WELL BEFORE USING</content>
                  </paragraph>
               </text>
