                     <code code="69719-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="HEALTH CLAIM SECTION"/>
                     <title>How to Use</title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>Fill dropper to appropriate line and dispense with a single squeeze of the dropper bulb. The full dose will be given. It is normal for a small amount to remain in the tip of the dropper.</paragraph>
                     </text>
